  QueensSet 2152979 to 2089740 with the forks 511583 to 511430, QueensSet9
  12143480 to 11784795 with the forks 2979048 to 2978740, PermSort
  12531154 to 12530839 (forks equal), Last 3100017 to 3100015 (forks
