  (tests/.cache/aside-prerewrite/icurry.db, 2,183 rows of format 3), the
  key of every corpus module computed under the digest of each era (the
  sources of flat2icurry at 1233abf8, 1b554fd1, aba8c864 and HEAD, with
  PORT_DIR mocked, and the Curry path of the drivers, the system library
