  in-memory pass; 2 with constrEq); 6 under aba8c864 and the same 6
  under HEAD (the digest has not changed since #85).  So the digest
  covered bindingopt.py from the day it joined PORT_DIR (frontend_digest
  digests every .py file there since 1233abf8), the rows of 2026-10-05
  were out of reach from 1b554fd1 on, and no hit served a pre-rewrite
