  header of the closure), and an include whose target exists nowhere is
  skipped, as the compiler would look on its own search path.  Unchanged:
  the two-line form of the stamp, the key of the product cache, the object
  format (13) and the flags of the flavors; the stamp's silence on the
  compiler flags stays issue #111.  Consequence: the digest changed
